{"synopsis":"Ye Gulou merupakan orang pertama yang dapat melakukan kultivasi abadi lewat jalan tersulit yakni Yang murni tak terikat Ia menjadi salah satu dari 6 orang terkuat di muka bumi Tapi melakukan kultivasi lewat Yang murni tak terikat artinya ia tak bisa berhubungan dengan wanita jika dilanggar maka dia akan mati Lalu bagaimana dengan haremnya yang sudah tumbuh hingga sekarang yang diisi oleh 5 gadis terkuat di muka bumi dikejar kelima gadis yang mencari kepastian akan cinta Ye Gulou pada mereka bagaimanakah nasib yang akan Ye Gulou hadapi","alternative_title":"妹子太多，只好飞升了","author":"LI Zhiheng","artist":"LI Zhiheng","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f1319407-febf-4e8a-8715-e4fe4d240a07","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"5c0c759a-1a6c-4073-bf5e-46528d5cf4fc","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"03b10b4c-acfe-48c8-b716-3b282e7d86ad","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"9ae6b241-52cd-48d7-9430-800f6c13b969","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"65d5467f-6b42-4d28-94ca-9866df1b6fe2","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"daeacaf2-e04f-4db9-9078-dfcc889297be","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"c6c5ea34-4793-4c20-bf04-43fc89d816ca","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"adcf0db5-918e-4528-9e36-ea993d72a322","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2024-12-03","released":"2024-12-03"},{"chapter_id":"f0f0357a-1966-45ba-918c-0f8f0e3d5e58","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23"},{"chapter_id":"c1a77dea-4117-4233-956d-8ac68a16a72a","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2024-11-23","